    {
      "name": "Deny the Witch",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "adeptusActor39It",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>When a psyker within Medium Range of the Sister Hospitaller Manifests a power, they may use their Reaction to attempt to disrupt it. The Sister Hospitaller makes a Willpower Test with the same Difficulty as the Psychic Power. If they succeed, subtract their SL from the psyker's SL. This may reduce their SL below 1 and cause the psychic power to fail.   Dialogus Teachings: The Sister Dialogus has Advantage on Tests made to find or retrieve information from a document or archive (whether analog or digital). They also gain Advantage on any tests made to learn, understand, or decipher a language, even if it is of xenos origin.  True Faith: The Sister Dialogus has 1 point of Fate</p>"
        },
